        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to introduce this stunning three -bedroom Semi-detached family home with garage to side and generous rear garden to the market in the highly sought-after residential location of Cedarwood Road in Glasnevin.\nCedarwood Road is a fantastic location within a mature and highly sought-after residential area renowned for its family-friendly environment, excellent amenities and superb connectivity. This well-established location offers a wealth of conveniences within easy reach, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families and those seeking to establish themselves in one of North Dublin's most desirable residential areas. This fantastic family home enjoys close proximity to a host of local amenities including Glasnevin Village, Finglas Village, Charlestown Shopping Centre, Clearwater Shopping Centre, IKEA, Dublin City University and the National Botanic Gardens. There is an excellent selection of both primary and secondary schools nearby, together with sports clubs, parks, recreational facilities and a wide variety of local shops, cafés and restaurants. Additionally, the area is well-served by direct bus routes to the city centre, along with the 19-bus route providing a direct link to Dublin Airport. The M50 and N2 are also easily accessible.\nBright and spacious living accommodation of c. 121 sqm comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway and a generous open-plan living room featuring an attractive fireplace. Double doors lead through to a bright sitting room overlooking the rear garden. The accommodation continues to a dining area and extended, fully fitted kitchen complete with an island. Off the kitchen is a separate utility room, together with a spacious downstairs wet room featuring a skylight. Upstairs hosts three generously proportioned bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a main family bathroom. No 100 Cedarwood Road is coming to the market in excellent condition throughout and benefits a large garage offering excellent storage and scope to suit a variety of uses, light filled interior, quality flooring throughout, generous rear garden and a large front driveway.\nAn opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>c. 121 sq.m</li>\n <li>Three Bedrooms | Two Bathrooms</li>\n <li>Semi-detached family home</li>\n <li>BER D</li>\n <li>Garage to side</li>\n <li>Extended kitchen with central island</li>\n <li>Generous rear garden</li>\n <li>Large front driveway</li>\n <li>Gas-fired central heating</li>\n <li>Double-glazed windows throughout</li>\n <li>Quality flooring throughout</li>\n <li>Mature and highly sought-after residential location</li>\n <li>Excellent primary, secondary schools and DCU in the area</li>\n <li>Walking distance to local shops and amenities</li>\n <li>Close to Glasnevin & Finglas Village</li>\n <li>Close to Charlestown Shopping Centre, Clearwater Shopping Centre and IKEA</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50 & N2 motorway</li>\n <li>Only 15 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport</li>\n <li>Easy access to Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Superb family home</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
